37250>>>>>    //
37250>>>>>    // This procedure is called when validating a session and after logging in. Its purpose is to 
37250>>>>>    // update properties based on the session and user data. Augment this function to update 
37250>>>>>    // properties based on the session / user table. Note that WebAppUser and WebAppSession contain
37250>>>>>    // the right records when this procedure is called.
37250>>>>>    //
37250>>>>>    // Params:
37250>>>>>    //      bClear   True if the procedure is called before session validation to clear properties.
37250>>>>>    //
37250>>>>>    Procedure UpdateSessionProperties Boolean bClear
37252>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
37252>>>>>        
37252>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
37253>>>>>        
37253>>>>>        //  Update user properties
37253>>>>>        If (not(bClear) and HasRecord(hoUserDD)) Begin
37255>>>>>            Set psUsername to (Trim(WebAppUser.FullName))
37256>>>>>            Set psLoginName to (Trim(WebAppUser.LoginName))
37257>>>>>            Set piUserRights to WebAppUser.Rights
37258>>>>>            
37258>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesSet 
37259>>>>>        End
37259>>>>>>
37259>>>>>        Else Begin
37260>>>>>            Set psUsername to ""
37261>>>>>            Set psLoginName to ""
37262>>>>>            Set piUserRights to 0
37263>>>>>            
37263>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesClear
37264>>>>>        End
37264>>>>>>
37264>>>>>    End_Procedure
37265>>>>>    
37265>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesSet
37267>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37267>>>>>    End_Procedure
37268>>>>>    
37268>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesClear
37270>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37270>>>>>    End_Procedure
37271>>>>>    
37271>>>>>    Procedure EndSession
37273>>>>>        Integer iErr
37273>>>>>        Boolean bLogWebSession
37273>>>>>        Handle hoSessionDD       
37273>>>>>        
37273>>>>>        Get phoSessionDD to hoSessionDD
37274>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37275>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37277>>>>>            Forward Send EndSession
37279>>>>>            Procedure_Return
37280>>>>>        End
37280>>>>>>
37280>>>>>            
37280>>>>>        //  Check if session exists
37280>>>>>        Send Clear of hoSessionDD
37281>>>>>        Get psSessionKey to WebAppSession.SessionKey
37282>>>>>        
37282>>>>>        Send Find of hoSessionDD EQ Index.1
37283>>>>>        If (Found) Begin
37285>>>>>            Set Field_Changed_Value of hoSessionDD Field WebAppSession.Active to "N"
37286>>>>>            Get Request_Validate of hoSessionDD to iErr
37287>>>>>            If (iErr) Begin
37289>>>>>                // this should not happen. If it does its a programming error
37289>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$WebAppSessionValidateFailed
37290>>>>>>
37290>>>>>                Procedure_Return
37291>>>>>            End
37291>>>>>>
37291>>>>>            Send Request_Save of hoSessionDD
37292>>>>>        End
37292>>>>>>
37292>>>>>    End_Procedure
