38201>>>>>>>>>
38201>>>>>>>>>// these define the three characters that define BOM for utf8.
38201>>>>>>>>>// These serve no purpos and are rarely used. If used they must be removed
38201>>>>>>>>>Define C_BOM1 for |CI$EF
38201>>>>>>>>>Define C_BOM2 for |CI$BB
38201>>>>>>>>>Define C_BOM3 for |CI$BF
38201>>>>>>>>>
38201>>>>>>>>>
38201>>>>>>>>>
38201>>>>>>>>>// define JSON transfer status codes used by peJsonTransferStatus
38201>>>>>>>>>Enum_List
38201>>>>>>>>>    Define jtsOk                 // ok
38201>>>>>>>>>    Define jtsHttpRequestFailed  // the post/get http request returned an error
38201>>>>>>>>>    Define jtsInvalidContentType // response content type not JSON
38201>>>>>>>>>    Define jtsNotJson            // return value not JSON (could not load in object)
38201>>>>>>>>>    Define jtsError              // unspecified return error
38201>>>>>>>>>End_Enum_List
38201>>>>>>>>>
