39487>>>                Case Break
39488>>>
39488>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
39488>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
39488>>>
39488>>>        Case End
39488>>>
39488>>>    End_Procedure
